        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-1789, Ornate Cutout Rosette for use with Small Knobs</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 6 inch Ornate Cabinet Backplate features a lovely cutout design that will be sure to add a sense of drama to any space. The BP-1789 rosette made by RK International is easy to install with the included hardware. While it would add a point of interest to any kitchen cabinet, we think that this fancy backplate would look just as beautiful as a backdrop for your dresser hardware as well as on a solid wood desk. It can be used with almost any cabinet knob like the <a href=\"/products/contoured-dome-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-192\">Contoured Dome Cabinet Knob</a>, the <a href=\"/products/melon-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-3249\">Melon Cabinet Knob</a>, and especially the <a href=\"/products/clear-acrylic-hammered-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-2ac\">Clear Acrylic Hammered Cabinet Knob</a>. Available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-1789:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BP-1789-finish.jpg?v=1704354609\" width=\"593\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
